                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div data-aos="fade" class="faculty-heading text-center my-5" style="background-color: #f0fdf4; padding: 50px 20px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.1);">
        <h2 style="color: #16a34a; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">
            Health & Safety
        </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-img">
                        <img src="~/User/img/Medical.png" alt="...">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><a>Medical Room / Nurse</a></h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Our college medical room is equipped to provide immediate care and support to students. A professional nurse attends to students in a clean, well-organized environment with essential medical supplies, ensuring health and safety on campus.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-img">
                        <img src="~/User/img/security.png" alt="...">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><a>Security</a></h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Our campus is equipped with a comprehensive security system, including CCTV surveillance and on-site security personnel. Cameras monitor key areas while guards ensure student safety, creating a secure and protected environment for learning and campus life.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-img">
                        <img src="~/User/img/Sanitation.png" alt="...">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><a>Sanitation</a></h5>
                        <p class="card-text">The college ensures a clean and hygienic campus through regular cleaning and maintenance. Trained sanitation staff use modern equipment to keep corridors and common areas spotless. Proper safety measures are followed to maintain a healthy and pleasant environment for everyone.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-img">
                        <img src="~/User/img/Emergency.png" alt="...">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><a>Emergency response</a></h5>
                        <p class="card-text">The college is equipped with a prompt and efficient emergency response system. Trained staff provide immediate first aid and assistance during medical or safety emergencies. Proper coordination and emergency equipment ensure the safety and well-being of students and staff at all times.</p>
